{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“椭圆复形”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"椭圆复形"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于微分算子的正合列\n$$\r\n\\cdots \\to \\Gamma(E_{k+1}) \\overset{D_k}{\\to} \\Gamma(E_{k}) \\to \\cdots\r\n$$\n若其"},{"Local":{"url":"象征","text":"象征"}},{"Plain":"构成的复形\n$$\r\n\\cdots \\to \\pi^*E_{k+1} \\overset{\\sigma(D_k)}{\\to} \\pi^* E_k \\to\\cdots\r\n$$\n为正合列, 则称 $(E_\\bullet,D_\\bullet)$ 椭圆复形.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>紧流形 $X$ 上的 de Rham 复形 $(\\Omega^\\bullet(X),d)$ 是椭圆复形, 其"},{"Local":{"url":"解析指标","text":"解析指标"}},{"Plain":"等于 $X$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}